# Whence Blows the Wind (jeuno 130, limit break 3): Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (the first of that name), qm2 in Castle
# Oztroja, qm1 in Monastic Cavern, qm1 in Qulun Dome (no scripts; defaults NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY,
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY, YOU_FIND_NOTHING). A level 56 Warrior at level cap 60 (a GM, before login), MAX_LEVEL 99.
# Available: a stone (no trade handler: nothing), 85 answered 0 and 2 (not 1: nothing), then 1 (begun). Accepted: 86;
# a stone (nil). Each ??? gives its crest, then nil once held (its default). Maat with one crest missing at a time (a
# GM): 86 each time; with the three: 87 (completed: Sky Breaker, the crests taken, level cap 65,
# YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_65); then Riding on the Clouds is not offered (it wants level 61): MAAT_DIALOG; a GM's cap 60
# again: this quest completed, no section: MAAT_DIALOG.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/85 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/87 CastleOztroja/qm2/onTrigger MonasticCavern/qm1/onTrigger QulunDome/qm1/onTrigger
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=56
levelcap 60
item FlintStone
login
trade Maat FlintStone x1                # available (cap 60): no trade handler, nothing
trigger Maat                            # cap 60, level 56: 85
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Maat                            # 85
finish option=2                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Maat                            # 85
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Maat                            # accepted, no crest: 86
finish
trade Maat FlintStone x1                # accepted: no trade handler, nil
warp -99,-63.2,60.3 CastleOztroja
trigger qm2                             # the Yagudo Crest
trigger qm2                             # held: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 169.3,-2.1,-21.3 MonasticCavern
trigger qm1                             # the Orcish Crest
trigger qm1                             # held: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 261.4,39.8,79.5 QulunDome
trigger qm1                             # the Quadav Crest
trigger qm1                             # held: nil; YOU_FIND_NOTHING
warp 12.4,3.1,119.5 RuludeGardens
delkeyitem OrcishCrest                  # a GM: the Orcish one missing
trigger Maat                            # 86
finish
keyitem OrcishCrest                     # a GM: back
delkeyitem QuadavCrest                  # the Quadav one missing
trigger Maat                            # 86
finish
keyitem QuadavCrest
delkeyitem YagudoCrest                  # the Yagudo one missing
trigger Maat                            # 86
finish
keyitem YagudoCrest
trigger Maat                            # the three crests: 87
finish                                  # completed: Sky Breaker, the crests taken, level cap 65, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_65
trigger Maat                            # Riding on the Clouds wants level 61: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
levelcap 60                             # a GM: cap 60 again
trigger Maat                            # this quest completed: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
